@node Top
@top Guile-Vulkan

This manual documents Guile-Vulkan @value{VERSION}: bindings to the
Vulkan @value{VULKAN} graphics and compute API for GNU Guile, generated
from the Vulkan headers, and @code{(vulkan compute)}, a small library
of GPU tensors built on them.

